  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear states, move_forward is used only in a short commit state, and obstacle events force conservative turn recovery. Recovery states use rotate_clockwise or rotate_counterclockwise as appropriate, and full_rotate is reserved for repeated or dead-end obstacles. All uncontrollables are total in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per state.",
